cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: Replicalm
abstract: >-
  Bare-earth lidar processing that reproduces a commercial workflow with open
  tools. Replicalm turns a raw airborne lidar point cloud into a bare-earth
  digital elevation model and the G1 relief visualization, following the NCALM
  workflow described in the Estrada-Belli et al. 2025 supplementary material
  using only PDAL, GDAL, NumPy and SciPy, with the Relief Visualization Toolbox
  for the optional image step. The published method depends on TerraScan for
  ground classification and Golden Surfer for interpolation and rasterization;
  Replicalm replaces both.
type: software
